<div style="height: 2.2em; font-size: large; font-weight: bold; font-family: Roboto-Regular; background-color: #8A8A8A; color: #FFF; vertical-align: middle;">
    <div style="height: 8px;"></div>
    <span style="padding-left: 20px;">Exit Interview Answers Form </span>
</div>
<div style="width: 99%; padding: 10px; background-color: White; border: 1px solid black; margin-left: 3px;">
    <div class="sep_heading">Introduction</div>
    <p>
        It&#39;s Unfortunate that you have decided to leave the company. We acknowledge
        your association with the company and the sincere efforts in performing your
        duties.
    </p>
    <p>
        Please help us make HMSI a better place to work by answering the following
        questionnaire. Your honest and open responses are important to us. The data
        obtained will be used to identify trends, identify areas of concern, and provide
        feedback to improve the same. It will also serve to enable us in developing
        policies and practices that reflect the needs of our employees.
    </p>
    <p>
        Once completed, the information will be confidentially reviewed in Human
        Resources. Your responses will not affect your future references or prospects
        for reemployment.
    </p>
    <br />
    <div class="sep_heading">Section 1: Personnel Information</div>
    <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed table-striped table-responsive" width="100%">
        <tbody>
            <tr class="row1" style="line-height: 25px;">
                <td style="width: 22%; text-align: right; vertical-align: top;"
                    class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Name :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="width: 23%; color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_name"  class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_name</label>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 25%; text-align: right; vertical-align: top;"
                    class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Ecode :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="width: 35%; color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_ecode" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_ecode</label>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="row2" style="line-height: 25px;">
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Age :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_age" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_age</label>
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Div & Dept :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_dept" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_dept</label>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="row1" style="line-height: 25px;">
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Qualification :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_qualification" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_qualification</label>
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Designation :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_designation" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_designation</label>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr class="row2" style="line-height: 25px;">
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Since :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_since" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_since</label>
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Location :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_loc" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_loc</label>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr class="row1" style="line-height: 25px;">
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Supervisors Designation :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_supdesign" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_supdesign</label>
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Supervisors Name :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_supname" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_supname</label>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr class="row2" style="line-height: 25px;">
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Date of Joining :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_doj" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_doj</label>
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Last Date of Employement :-
                </td>
                <td class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_lastdateemp" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_lastdateemp</label>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="row2" style="line-height: 25px;">
                <td style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;" class="font12">
                    &nbsp;Exit Interview Date :-
                </td>
                <td colspan="3" class="smalltext" style="color: #6299c5; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                    &nbsp;<label id="lbl_EXINTDATE" class="lblcss">@Model.EmpDetailsModel?.lbl_EXINTDATE</label>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <br />


@foreach (var sec in Model.ExitInterviewQuestionModel)
{
        <h4 class="sep_heading">Section @sec.SectionId: @sec.SectionTitle</h4>
        <table class="table table-bordered" style="width: 100%; padding: 0;font-size:13px;">
        @foreach (var question in sec.Questions)
        {
            var answerSection = Model.ExitInterviewAnswerViewModel
                .FirstOrDefault(s => s.SectionId == sec.SectionId);

            var answer = answerSection?.Questions
                .FirstOrDefault(a => a.ExitInterviewQusId == question.ExitInterviewQusId);

            <tr>
                <td>
                    <strong>@question.QusDesc</strong><br />

                    @if (question.QusType == "3") 
                    {
                        foreach (var opt in question.Options)
                        {
                                bool isChecked = answer?.SelectedOptions.Contains(opt.ExitInterviewOptionId) == true;
                                string style = (sec.SectionId == "3" && question.QusType == "3" && isChecked)
                                ? "color:red; font-weight:bold;" : "";

                                <label style="@style">
                                    <input type="checkbox" disabled @(isChecked ? "checked" : "") />
                                    @opt.OptionDesc
                                </label>

                                <br />
                            @* <label>
                               <input type="checkbox" disabled @(answer?.SelectedOptions.Contains(opt.ExitInterviewOptionId) == true ? "checked" : "") />
                               @opt.OptionDesc
                            </label><br /> *@
                        }
                    }
                    else if (question.QusType == "2") // Radio
                    {
                         <div class="horizontal-radio">
                        @foreach (var opt in question.Options)
                        {
                            <label>
                                <input type="radio" name="radio_@question.ExitInterviewQusId" disabled @(answer?.SelectedOption == opt.ExitInterviewOptionId ? "checked" : "") />
                                @opt.OptionDesc
                            </label><br />
                        }
                        </div>
                    }
                    else // Text or fallback
                    {
                        <textarea class="form-control" rows="3" readonly>@answer?.TextAns</textarea>
                    }
                </td>
            </tr>
        }
    </table>
}

  
</div>
